			"Message": "chore(build): exclude empty generated files from tracking\n\n- Removed Empty.js.map (0 bytes) as it's an unnecessary build artifact\n- Added Empty.js to .gitignore to prevent tracking empty generated files\n\nThese files were likely produced by the Rest JS bundler component during build processes but serve no runtime purpose. Excluding them reduces repository noise and aligns with Land's goal of maintaining a lean disk footprint. This change complements the existing build pipeline configuration without affecting Mountain, Cocoon, or other core components.",
			"SHA": "55800731dbf26bd0b710ca68696e56f599827d30"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
