			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				23,
				2
			],
			"Message": "chore(build): exclude generated target files from tracking\n\n- Adds Target/Empty.js (modified, 0→97B) and Target/Empty.js.map (new, 161B) to exclusion list\n- Prevents tracking of dynamically generated build artifacts that should not be version controlled\n- Aligns with Land's goal of maintaining clean repository state by avoiding build output pollution\n- Particularly relevant for Cocoon extension host shim layer where Rest bundler generates temporary files\n- Reduces noise in commit history while preserving focus on core Mountain/Sky architecture changes",
