			"Message": "docs(LICENSE): Relicense project under CC0 1.0 Universal\n\n- Replaces custom Land Public License v1.0 with CC0 public domain dedication\n- Removes copyleft requirements and complex license compatibility clauses\n- Aligns with Land project's goal of fostering open collaboration by allowing\n  unrestricted use/modification/distribution of core editor components\n- Simplifies third-party contributions by eliminating license compliance overhead\n- Maintains project's commitment to open source while reducing legal barriers\n- CC0 choice enables maximum adoption potential and ecosystem growth around Land\n- Preserves copyright notices but waives all rights under copyright/publicity laws\n- Affects all project components except external dependencies governed by their\n  own licenses (e.g. VS Code UI code remains under MIT)",
