			"Message": "chore(docs): normalize documentation URLs to lowercase\n\n- Converted all uppercase `HTTPS://` URLs in documentation files (CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, README.md) and package.json to lowercase `https://`\n- Updated GitHub repository URLs and project homepage links to use consistent casing\n- Maintains project professionalism and follows web URL conventions where scheme identifiers are typically lowercase\n- Prevents potential edge cases in environments with case-sensitive path resolution\n- No functional changes to Land's core components (Mountain, Cocoon, Vine) or extension shimming logic",
