			"Message": "docs: Adopt Land Public License v1.0\n\n- Replaced CC0 1.0 Universal with custom Land Public License (LPL) v1.0\n- Introduces copyleft provisions requiring derivative works to remain open under LPL\n- Maintains separation from External Works' licenses to support VS Code extension integration via Cocoon\n- Adds patent grant with defensive termination clause to protect contributors\n- Implements source code distribution requirements for executable builds\n- Establishes Sofia, Bulgaria as jurisdiction for dispute resolution\n- Aligns with Land's goals of fostering open collaboration while protecting core project contributions\n- Enables commercial use while ensuring modifications to Land itself remain open-source\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Changes from permissive CC0 to reciprocal LPL license requiring derivative works to remain open under same terms",
